dPress app: Kotlin, Java, Swift, Objective-C, Vue, Python, je TypeScript.','WordPress Core and Block Editor: HTML, CSS, PHP, SQL, JavaScript, and React.'=>'WordPress Core je Block Editor: HTML, CSS, PHP, SQL, JavaScript, je React.','WordPress embraces new technologies, while being committed to backward compatibility. The WordPress project uses the following languages and libraries:'=>'WordPress nIvbogh nIvbogh Qapchuʼmey chayʼ yItlhutlh, ’ach loS QumpInmey yImev. WordPress ghompuʼ QumpInmey wIloʼ:','<strong>Contribute</strong> to the code, improve the UX, and test the WordPress app.'=>'<strong>Qaplaʼ yItlhutlh</strong>, UX vIchenmoH, WordPress app yIqeq.','<strong>Write</strong> and submit patches to fix bugs or help build new features.'=>'<strong>Qum</strong> je vIghroSmey yItlhutlh, Qapchuʼmey vIchenmoH.','<strong>Test</strong> new releases and proposed features for the Block Editor.'=>'<strong>Qeq</strong> chuʼmey je Qapchuʼmey Block Editor Daq yIqeq.','<strong>Find</strong> and report bugs in the WordPress core software.'=>'<strong>Qum</strong> je Qapchuʼmey WordPress ghompuʼ mIghmey.','If you do code, or want to learn how, you can contribute technically in numerous ways:'=>'Qum DapDaq, pagh wIghItlhqang, DuqarlaHbej, Hoch mIwDaq Qap.','Code-based contribution'=>'Qum Qaplaʼ DapDaq','<strong>Explore</strong> ways to reduce the environmental impact of websites.'=>'<strong>HochHom</strong> mIw wImaj mIghwIʼmey yIlo.','<strong>Edit</strong> videos and add captions to WordPress.tv.'=>'<strong>Qum</strong> vIbejmey je WordPress.tv Daq DanoHmey yIqeq.','<strong>Lend</strong> your creative imagination to the WordPress UI design.'=>'<strong>Huchmey yIqeq</strong> WordPress UI patmey.','<strong>Organize</strong> or participate in local Meetups and WordCamps.'=>'<strong>QutluchmeH</strong> pagh Dujmey je WordCamps yIqeq.','<strong>Curate</strong> submissions or take photos for the Photo Directory.'=>'<strong>QutluchmeH</strong> Qummey pagh mIllogh Daq yoS yIqeq.','<strong>Promote</strong> the WordPress project to your community.'=>'<strong>Qaplaʼ yItlhutlh</strong> WordPress ghompuʼ bIngDaq.','<strong>Create</strong> and improve WordPress educational materials.'=>'<strong>QumpInmey yIqeq</strong> WordPress Holmey Daq.','<strong>Translate</strong> WordPress into your local language.'=>'<strong>Qum</strong> WordPress Hol bIngDaq.','<strong>Write</strong> or improve documentation for WordPress.'=>'<strong>Qum</strong> pagh QumpInmey WordPress Daq yIqeq.','<strong>Share</strong> your knowledge in the WordPress support forums.'=>'<strong>Qaplaʼ yItlhutlh</strong> WordPress Daq Qumvam mIw.','WordPress may thrive on technical contributions, but you don&#8217;t have to code to contribute. Here are some of the ways you can make an impact without writing a single line of code:'=>'WordPress Qum Qaplaʼmey wIloʼ, ’ach QumwIʼ paghbeʼlaH. vayʼ Hochmey wIloʼ bIghajbeʼ vaj:','No-code contribution'=>'Qum paghbeʼ DapDaq','Grow your network and make friends.'=>'loSparmey yIqeq, jupmey yImev.','Apply your skills or learn new ones.'=>'SuvwIj DapDaq yIqeq, pagh SuvwIj wIghItlh.','Be part of a global open source community.'=>'HochHom Holmey bIngDaq QumwIʼ yImev.','Join the diverse WordPress contributor community and connect with other people who are passionate about maintaining a free and open web.'=>'WordPress ghompuʼ QumpInmey mIwDaq yImev, Holmey yIqeq HochHom vIghroʼmey je vIghroSmey.','Do you use WordPress for work, for personal projects, or even just for fun? You can help shape the long-term success of the open source project that powers millions of websites around the world.'=>'WordPress DapDaq tIqDaq, Daqmey tIqDaq, pagh yIqeqmeH Suv. meQmey Holmey bIngDaq QumwIʼ vItlhutlh.','Be the future of WordPress'=>'WordPress tera\'ngan','<a href="%1$s">Learn WordPress</a> is a free resource for new and experienced WordPress users. Learn is stocked with how-to videos on using various features in WordPress, <a href="%2$s">interactive workshops</a> for exploring