in qoSbogh version WordPress SoHbe\'be\'.','This plugin does not work with your versions of WordPress and PHP.'=>'vaj plug-in qoSbogh version WordPress je PHP SoHbe\'be\'.','https://wordpress.org/documentation/wordpress-version/version-%s/'=>'https://wordpress.org/documentation/wordpress-version/version-%s/','Resume'=>'chu\'lu\'','You can find more details and make changes on the Themes screen.'=>'tlhoy\'meyvam Dunmo\' je ghu\'vam lo\'laHghachmey theme mIwDaq.','One or more themes failed to load properly.'=>'wa\' pagh thememey lo\'laHbe\' tlhoy.','Could not resume the theme.'=>'theme chu\'lu\'be\' vItu\'be\'.','Deleting a category does not delete the posts in that category. Instead, posts that were only assigned to the deleted category are set to the default category %s. The default category cannot be deleted.'=>'category chuSbejbe\' categoryDaq chuSbejmey je. vaj, category chuSbejbe\' categoryDaq chuSbejmey vItlhutlhmey category %s je categoryDaq vItlhutlh. category chuSbejbe\'be\'.','The block widgets require JavaScript. Please enable JavaScript in your browser settings, or install the <a href="%s">Classic Widgets plugin</a>.'=>'block widgets JavaScript vIje\'lu\'. JavaScript browser settingsDaq Qapchu\'lu\'ghach, pagh <a href="%s">Classic Widgets plugin</a> vItlhutlh.','A post type mismatch has been detected.'=>'post Type Qapbe\' vItlhutlh.','A post ID mismatch has been detected.'=>'post ID Qapbe\' vItlhutlh.','Please open the <a href="%s">classic editor</a> to use this meta box.'=>'<a href="%s">classic editor</a> vItlhutlh meta box vItlhutlh.','Please activate the <a href="%s">Classic Editor plugin</a> to use this meta box.'=>'<a href="%s">Classic Editor plugin</a> vItlhutlh meta box vItlhutlh.','Please install the <a href="%s">Classic Editor plugin</a> to use this meta box.'=>'<a href="%s">Classic Editor plugin</a> vItlhutlh meta box vItlhutlh.','This meta box is not compatible with the block editor.'=>'meta box block editor rIntaHbe\'.','To distribute copies of your modified versions to others.'=>'modified versions copies Daq distribute.','The 4th Freedom'=>'4vat Freedom','To redistribute.'=>'redistribute.','The 3rd Freedom'=>'3vat Freedom','To study how the program works and change it to make it do what you wish.'=>'program chay\' Daq Study vItlhutlh, wIv vItlhutlh.','The 2nd Freedom'=>'2vat Freedom','To run the program for any purpose.'=>'program vIghro\'meH.','The 1st Freedom'=>'1vat Freedom','Created'=>'Created','Welcome to WordPress. This is your first post. Edit or delete it, then start writing!'=>'WordPress lo\'laH. wa\'logh post yIlo\'! wIv, delete, Qapchu\'!','As a new WordPress user, you should go to <a href="%s">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!'=>'WordPress user Hutlh, <a href="%s">dashboard</a> Daq page delete, new pages Daq yIgho\'. Qapchu\'!','The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.'=>'XYZ Doohickey Company 1971 ben, quality doohickeys publicDaq. Gotham CityDaq, XYZ 2000 nuvpu\' je Gotham community Dalo\'.','...or something like this:'=>'... pagh vIghro\'vam:','Hi there! I\'m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like pi&#241;a coladas. (And gettin\' caught in the rain.)'=>'nuqneH! bike messenger jaj, actor poHpu\' Soj, website vIghaj. Los Angeles vIje\', dog Jack pong, piña coladas vIparHa\'.','This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:'=>'vaj example page. blog post Qapbe\' vItlhutlh, site navigationDaq (themesDaq) nIvbogh. vaj About page nIvbogh visitors. vajvam vIghro\'vam:','Export &#8220;%s&#8221; as JSON'=>'Export &#8220;%s&#8221; as JSON','1 pattern not updated, somebody is editing it.'=>'wa\' patmey lo\'laHbe\' \'ej vaj SoHvaD cham.','%s pattern restored from the Trash.'=>'%s patmey vItlhutlhmeH QachDaq bIngDaq puS.' . "\0" . '%s patmey vItlhutlhmeH QachDaq bIngDaq puS.','<strong>Error:</strong> "Table Prefix" must not be empty.'=>'<strong>Qagh:</strong> "Qach Qachmey" vIghro\'vam wo\' vIghro\'vam vIghro\'vam.','This meta box, from the %s plugin, is not compatible with the block editor.'=>'vaj %s plugin Daq Daq meta boxvam, block editor vIghro\'vam vIghro\'vam.','<a href="%1$s">Edit</a> or <a href="%2$s">preview</a> your Privacy Policy page content.'=>'<a href="%1$s">chIj</a> pagh <a href="%2$s">neHmey</a> Privacy Policy pageDaq.','Privacy Policy Page'=>'Privacy Policy page','%s (Draft)'=>'%s (Dalo\')','Privacy Policy page updated successfully.'=>'Privacy Policy page tIqwIjDaq legh.','The suggested privacy policy content should be added by using the %s (or later) action. Please see the inline documentation.'=>'vaj %s (ghobe\' pagh vIghro\'vam) actionDaq privacy policy Daqmey tIqwI\'pu\'bogh vItlhutlh. DochmeyDaq yItlho\'.','The suggested privacy policy content should be added only in wp-admin by using the %s (or later) action.'=>'vaj %s (ghobe\' pagh vIghro\'vam) actionDaq wp-adminDaq privacy policy Daqmey tIqwI\'pu\'bogh vItlhutlh.','The suggested privacy policy text has changed. Please <a href="%s">review the guide</a> and update your privacy policy.'=>'','There are no pages.'=>'Qachmeyvam QIHbe\'.','Need help putting together your new Privacy Policy page? <a href="%1$s" %2$s>Check out the privacy policy guide%3$s</a> for recommendations on what content to include, along with policies suggested by your plugins and theme.'=>'vaj Privacy Policy page chu\' Daqvam chu\'vaD QaH. <a href="%1$s" %2$s>privacy policy guide%3$s</a> Daqmey, pluginmey \'ej themeDaq policies vItlhutlh.','Privacy Policy Guide'=>'Privacy Policy Guide','Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.'=>'vaj mIwDaq visitor comments vIqel automated spam detection service.','In this subsection you should note what analytics package you use, how users can opt out of analytics tracking, and a link to your analytics provider&#8217;s privacy policy, if any.'=>'vaj subsectionDaq analytics package lurDech, users analytics tracking tIqwIj, analytics provider privacy policy link vItlhutlh.','In this subsection you should note what information may be disclosed by users who can upload media files. All uploaded files are usually publicly accessible.'=>'vaj subsectionDaq media files upload users, cha\'logh Daqmey vItlhutlh public.','In this subsection you should note what information is captured through comments. We have noted the data which WordPress collects by default.'=>'vaj subsectionDaq comments Daqmey vItlhutlh. WordPress default Daqmey vItlhutlh.','In this section you should note what personal data you collect from users and site visitors. This may include personal data, such as name, email address, personal account preferences; transactional data, such as purchase information; and technical data, such as information about cookies.'=>'vaj sectionDaq personal data users \'ej site visitors vItlhutlh. pong, email, account preferences; transactional data, purchase information; technical data, cookies.','Suggested text:'=>'Suggested text:','The template contains a suggestion of sections you most likely will need. Under each section heading, you will find a short summary of what information you should provide, which will help you to get started. Some sections include suggested policy content, others will have to be completed with information from your theme and plugins.'=>'vaj templateDaq sections vItlhutlh. section headingsDaq summary vItlhutlh. some sections suggested policy content vItlhutlh, others theme \'ej plugins Daqmey.','Updated %s.'=>'Updated %s.','You deactivated this plugin on %s and may no longer need this policy.'=>'vaj %s plugin deactivate \'e\' DaSovpu\'. policyvam Qapbe\' \'e\' yIbuS.','Removed %s.'=>'Removed %s.','Introduction'=>'Introduction','Need help putting together your new Privacy Policy page? Check out the guide for recommendations on what content to include, along with policies suggested by your plugins and theme.'=>'vaj Privacy Policy page chu\'vam QaH. guideDaq content \'ej policies plugin \'ej theme vItlhutlh.','Erasing data...'=>'vaj Data vItlhutlh...','Add Data Erasure Request'=>'Add Data Erasure Request','Send export link'=>'Send export link','If you are a member of a regulated industry, or if you are subject to additional privacy laws, you may be required to disclose that information here.'=>'vaj qatlh mIw\'e\' puS, pagh SoHvaD qonwI\'pu\' mIw, pagh vaj wejpuH Qu\' luchu\' \'oH jIH.','Industry regulatory disclosure requirements'=>'mIw\'e\' qonwI\'pu\' Seghmey qonwI\' SIchmey','If your website provides a service which includes automated decision making - for example, allowing customers to apply for credit, or aggregating their data into an advertising profile - you must note that this is taking place, and include information about how that information is used, what decisions are made with that aggregated data, and what rights users have over decisions made without human intervention.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' Qorwagh chenmoH - qechmey, pagh \'ach Qapchu\' lo\'laHghach meqmey, pagh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je - SoH Daghaj jIH, \'ej QIn \'oH ngeHbej, \'ej Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' \'ej Daghajbogh \'oH Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' \'ej Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' \'ej Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' \'ej Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' \'ej Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\'.','What automated decision making and/or profiling we do with user data'=>'nuq \'oH chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\' je/ghaH chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je','If your website receives data about users from third parties, including advertisers, this information must be included within the section of your privacy policy dealing with third party data.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, latlh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','What third parties we receive data from'=>'nuq \'oH latlh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je','In this section you should explain what procedures you have in place to deal with data breaches, either potential or real, such as internal reporting systems, contact mechanisms, or bug bounties.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','What data breach procedures we have in place'=>'nuq \'oH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je chenmoH mIw','In this section you should explain what measures you have taken to protect your users&#8217; data. This could include technical measures such as encryption; security measures such as two factor authentication; and measures such as staff training in data protection. If you have carried out a Privacy Impact Assessment, you can mention it here too.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','How we protect your data'=>'nuq \'oH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je chenmoH mIw','If you use your site for commercial purposes and you engage in more complex collection or processing of personal data, you should note the following information in your privacy policy in addition to the information we have already discussed.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','Additional information'=>'latlh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\'','In this section you should provide a contact method for privacy-specific concerns. If you are required to have a Data Protection Officer, list their name and full contact details here as well.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','European data protection law requires data about European residents which is transferred outside the European Union to be safeguarded to the same standards as if the data was in Europe. So in addition to listing where data goes, you should describe how you ensure that these standards are met either by yourself or by your third party providers, whether that is through an agreement such as Privacy Shield, model clauses in your contracts, or binding corporate rules.'=>'Europe vItlhutlh qonwI\'pu\' Qorwagh je Qorwagh, vaj De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Qorwagh je Qorwagh, vaj De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Qorwagh je Qorwagh.','In this section you should list all transfers of your site data outside the European Union and describe the means by which that data is safeguarded to European data protection standards. This could include your web hosting, cloud storage, or other third party services.'=>'vaj De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Qorwagh je Qorwagh, vaj De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Qorwagh je Qorwagh, vaj De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Qorwagh je Qorwagh.','If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','In this section you should explain what rights your users have over their data and how they can invoke those rights.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','What rights you have over your data'=>'nuq \'oH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je chenmoH mIw','For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','In this section you should explain how long you retain personal data collected or processed by the website. While it is your responsibility to come up with the schedule of how long you keep each dataset for and why you keep it, that information does need to be listed here. For example, you may want to say that you keep contact form entries for six months, analytics records for a year, and customer purchase records for ten years.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','How long we retain your data'=>'nuq \'oH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je chenmoH mIw','By default WordPress does not share any personal data with anyone.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','In this section you should name and list all third party providers with whom you share site data, including partners, cloud-based services, payment processors, and third party service providers, and note what data you share with them and why. Link to their own privacy policies if possible.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','Who we share your data with'=>'nuq \'oH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je chenmoH mIw','By default WordPress does not collect any analytics data. However, many web hosting accounts collect some anonymous analytics data. You may also have installed a WordPress plugin that provides analytics services. In that case, add information from that plugin here.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','Analytics'=>'QumwI\' Qorwagh','These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.'=>'vaj SoH pa\'logh De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' Daqawlu\' je Qorwagh, je jejlaw\'pu\' \'oH, vaj Daghajbogh chenmoH De\'wI\' qonwI\'pu\' je.','Embedded content from other websites'=>'latlh mIw\'e\' qonwI\'pu\' Qorwagh je','If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.'=>'vaj wIv pagh chu\' ghojwI\' ghojmeH, browserlIjDaq cookie vItlhutlh. cha\'logh vItlhutlh \'oHbe\' personal data \'ej QIn ID vIqawlu\' vItlhutlh. wa\' jaj qa\'vam vIghItlh.','When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.'=>'vaj log In, wej cookie vIghItlh Daqawlu\' mIw logIn chenmoHmeH \'ej mIvwIj mIw chenmoHmeH. logIn cookie cha\' jaj Qav, mIvwIj mIw cookie wa\' DIS Qav. &quot;vaj yImev&quot; ghojmeH, logIn wej jar Qav. account log \'oHmo\', logIn cookie wIghItlh.','If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.'=>'vaj logIn ghojmeH, temp cookie vIghItlhmeH browser cookie SIch vIqaw. cookie personal data \'oHbe\' \'ej browser wIqem ghopDu\' vIghItlh.','If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.'=>'vaj comment ghojmeH, ponglIj, email, website cookie vIghItlhmeH yIjatlh. neH DaghajmeH, comment chenmoHmoHmeH, cookie DIS wa\' Qav Qav.','In this subsection you should list the cookies your website uses, including those set by your plugins, social media, and analytics. We have provided the cookies which WordPress installs by default.'=>'vaj subsections Daqawlu\' cookie SoQ, plugin, social media, analytics. WordPress default cookie vIghItlh.','Cookies'=>'cookie','An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.'=>'email ponglIjDaq Quchmey (hash) Gravatar vIghItlhmeH. Gravatar privacy policy Hegh: https://automattic.com/privacy/. comment vIghItlhmeH, profile pic public vIghItlh.','When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.'=>'comment chenmoHmoH, comment form vIghItlh, IP address \'ej browser user agent string vIghItlh spam vItlhutlhmeH.','By default, WordPress does not include a contact form. If you use a contact form plugin, use this subsection to note what personal data is captured when someone submits a contact form, and how long you keep it. For example, you may note that you keep contact form submissions for a certain period for customer service purposes, but you do not use the information submitted through them for marketing purposes.'=>'WordPress contact form \'oHbe\'. contact form plugin vIghItlhmeH, personal data, wa\' Qav, customer service purpose vIqaw, marketing purpose \'oHbe\'.','Contact forms'=>'contact form','If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.'=>'image upload, location data (EXIF GPS) upload vIghItlhbe\'. website vIghItlh, location data image vIghItlh.','By default WordPress does not collect any personal data about visitors, and only collects the data shown on the User Profile screen from registered users. However some of your plugins may collect personal data. You should add the relevant information below.'=>'WordPress personal data vIghItlhbe\' visitors, User Profile vIghItlh registered users. plugin personal data vIghItlh. info Daqawlu\'.','Personal data is not just created by a user&#8217;s interactions with your site. Personal data is also generated from technical processes such as contact forms, comments, cookies, analytics, and third party embeds.'=>'personal data user interaction \'oHbe\', contact form, comment, cookie, analytics, third party embed vIghItlh.','In addition to listing what personal data you collect, you 