 vItlhutlh:','No further action is needed on your part.'=>'bIjatlhbe\'chugh, vItlhutlh mIw yIbuS.','Howdy! Your site at %1$s has been updated automatically to WordPress %2$s.'=>'nuqneH! %1$s tIghvam WordPress %2$s vItlhutlhmeH wovbe\' vItlhutlh.','[%1$s] URGENT: Your site may be down due to a failed update'=>'[%1$s] QAPLA\': tIghvam word update lo\'laHbe\' vIghItlh','[%1$s] WordPress %2$s is available. Please update!'=>'[%1$s] WordPress %2$s vItlhutlh. yIQaw!','[%1$s] Your site has updated to WordPress %2$s'=>'[%1$s] tIghvam WordPress %2$s vItlhutlh.','Translations for %s'=>'%s mIw tIghmey','Updating translations for %1$s (%2$s)&#8230;'=>'%1$s (%2$s) mIw tIghmey vItlhutlh&#8230;','Update Translations'=>'mIw tIghmey','Background updates'=>'Background mIw','There is not enough free disk space to complete the update.'=>'mIw tIghvam vItlhutlhbe\' vIghoSbogh disk mIw vIghItlhbe\'.','Updating plugin: %s'=>'plugin %s mIw tIghmey','Updating theme: %s'=>'theme %s mIw tIghmey','Translation updated successfully.'=>'mIw tIghmey Qapchu\' vItlhutlh.','Translation update failed.'=>'mIw tIghmey Qapchu\'be\'.','Some of your translations need updating. Sit tight for a few more seconds while they are updated as well.'=>'tIghmeyvam DaH mIw tIghmey vIghItlh. poHmey vItlhutlhmeH yIqel.','Create a brand new user and add them to this site.'=>'cha\'logh yIghItlh \'ej tIghvamDaq vIlIgh.','Upgrading to a newer version of the same theme will override changes made here. To avoid this, consider creating a <a href="%s">child theme</a> instead.'=>'mIw tIghvam yIghItlhmeH <a href="%s">child theme</a> yIpoSmeH, theme vItlhutlhvam vItlhutlhmeH yIchel.','The sizes listed below determine the maximum dimensions in pixels to use when adding an image to the Media Library.'=>'pIm sizevam \'oH pixelsDaq Media LibraryDaq image yIghItlhmeH mIw.','Comment must be manually approved'=>'qel vIghItlhmeH mIw','<strong>Clicking the arrow to the right of any menu item</strong> in the editor will reveal a standard group of settings. Additional settings such as link target, CSS classes, link relationships, and link descriptions can be enabled and disabled via the Screen Options tab.'=>'<strong>menu item HochDaq arrow mIw yIghItlh</strong> editorDaq settings mIw vItlhutlh. link target, CSS classes, link relationships, link descriptions wIvpu\' settings Screen Options tabDaq yItlhutlh \'ej yIbuS.','Menus can be displayed in locations defined by your theme, even used in sidebars by adding a &#8220;Navigation Menu&#8221; widget on the <a href="%1$s">Widgets</a> screen. If your theme does not support the navigation menus feature (the default themes, %2$s and %3$s, do), you can learn about adding this support by following the documentation link to the side.'=>'Menus themeDaq mIw yIghItlh, Widgets <a href="%1$s">Widgets</a> screenDaq "Navigation Menu" widget yIghItlh. themeDach navigation menus feature vIghItlhbe\' (default themes, %2$s \'ej %3$s, yIghItlh), documentation link vIghItlhmeH yIghItlh.','Your theme does not natively support menus, but you can use them in sidebars by adding a &#8220;Navigation Menu&#8221; widget on the <a href="%s">Widgets</a> screen.'=>'SoHvaD SuvwI\'pu\' menu neH \'oHbe\' \'ach tlhIngan Hol vIghro\' \'e\' nID, \'ach SidebarsDaq menu vIlo\' \'oH &#8220;Navigation Menu&#8221; widget <a href="%s">Widgets</a> mIwDaq.','Sorry, that is not a valid email address. Email addresses look like <code>username@example.com</code>.'=>'jIyajbe\', ghaH email chenmoHbe\'be\' mIw. Email chenmoHbe\'pu\' <code>username@example.com</code> ghap.','You must provide an email address.'=>'email chenmoHbe\' vIghajmeH tlhIH.','Your passwords do not match. Please try again.'=>'ngeDmeylIj qeylIj qonlu\'. jIyIn vItlhutlh.','The username you provided has invalid characters.'=>'username tlhIH chenmoHbe\' chay\' tlhutlhmey vIghro\'pu\'.','Please provide a valid username.'=>'username tlhIH chenmoHbe\' chay\' tlhutlhmey vIghro\'pu\'.','Copying the required files&#8230;'=>'ghItlhmey vIghItlhmoH&#8230;','Preparing to install the latest version&#8230;'=>'chu\'logh wIv version vIghItlhmoH&#8230;','This password will not be stored on the server.'=>'passwordDaj vIghItlhbe\' \'e\' DaqaSchoHbe\'.','The checksum of the file (%1$s) does not match the expected checksum value (%2$s).'=>'ghItlh checksum (%1$s) vItlhutlhmeH checksum DaqaSchoHbe\' (%2$s).','WordPress %s'=>'WordPress %s','Updating to WordPress %s'=>'WordPress %s vIghItlhmoH','Due to an error during updating, WordPress has been restored to your previous version.'=>'vIghItlhmoH DaqaSchoHbe\' \'ej WordPress qay\'lu\' vItlhutlhmoH.','Looking for %1$s in %2$s'=>'%2$sDaq %1$s wIv','%s page restored from the Trash.'=>'%s page Qapchu\' TrashDaq vIchup.' . "\0" . '%s pages Qapchu\' TrashDaq vIchup.','%s page moved to the Trash.'=>'%s page TrashDaq vIghItlh.' . "\0" . '%s pages TrashDaq vIghItlh.','%s page permanently deleted.'=>'%s page poSmoHmeH Dechlu\'.' . "\0" . '%s pages poSmoHmeH Dechlu\'.','%s page not updated, somebody is editing it.'=>'%s page vIghItlhbe\' \'e\' DaqaSchoHbe\' tlhIngan puqloD joH\'a\'.' . "\0" . '%s pages vIghItlhbe\' \'e\' DaqaSchoHbe\' tlhIngan puqloD joH\'a\'pu\'.','%s page updated.'=>'%s page vIghItlh.' . "\0" . '%s pages vIghItlh.','%s post restored from the Trash.'=>'%s post Qapchu\' TrashDaq vIchup.' . "\0" . '%s posts Qapchu\' TrashDaq vIchup.','%s post moved to the Trash.'=>'%s post TrashDaq vIghItlh.' . "\0" . '%s posts TrashDaq vIghItlh.','%s post permanently deleted.'=>'%s post poSmoHmeH Dechlu\'.' . "\0" . '%s posts poSmoHmeH Dechlu\'.','%s post not updated, somebody is editing it.'=>'%s post vIghItlhbe\' \'e\' DaqaSchoHbe\' tlhIngan puqloD joH\'a\'.' . "\0" . '%s posts vIghItlhbe\' \'e\' DaqaSchoHbe\' tlhIngan puqloD joH\'a\'pu\'.','Tags deleted.'=>'Tags Dechlu\'.','Tag not updated.'=>'Tag vIghItlhbe\'.','Tag not added.'=>'Tag vIlo\'be\'.','Tag updated.'=>'Tag vIghItlh.','Tag deleted.'=>'Tag Dechlu\'.','Tag added.'=>'Tag vIlo\'.','Categories deleted.'=>'Categories Dechlu\'.','Category not updated.'=>'woq qeylIS machmey vIlo’be’.','Category not added.'=>'woq qeylIS machmey vInobbe’.','Category updated.'=>'woq qeylIS machmey vIlo’.','Category deleted.'=>'woq qeylIS machmey vIghaj.','Category added.'=>'woq qeylIS machmey vInob.','Compare two different revisions by <strong>selecting the &#8220;Compare any two revisions&#8221; box</strong> to the side.'=>'cha’logh mIw chenmoHmeH <strong>&#8220;cha’logh mIw chenmoHmeH qutlhmey&#8221; box</strong> qonwI’vaD vIghro’.','Compare any two revisions'=>'cha’logh mIw chenmoHmeH qutlhmey','Restore This Autosave'=>'vaj Qapchu’ chu’','Current Revision by %s'=>'DaHmey mIw chenmoH %s','Autosave by %s'=>'Qapchu’ cha’logh %s','Revisions: %s'=>'mIw chenmoHmey: %s','"%s".'=>'"%s".','"%1$s" by %2$s.'=>'"%1$s" %2$s vIjatlh.','"%1$s" from %2$s.'=>'"%1$s" %2$s ’ej.','"%1$s" from %2$s by %3$s.'=>'"%1$s" %2$s ’ej %3$s vIjatlh.','Revision by %s'=>'mIw chenmoH %s','<strong>Connection lost.</strong> Saving has been disabled until you are reconnected.'=>'<strong>QeHmey lo’bej.</strong> Qapchu’ vItoybe’ ’ach reH vIghro’ vItIv.','Repeat Password'=>'mIch qonwI’','Repeat New Password'=>'mIch qonwI’ Qutlh','Add menu items from the column on the left.'=>'toH leghlaHbe’ mIchmey le’ ghoS.','Plugins extend and expand the functionality of WordPress. You may install plugins from the <a href="%s">WordPress Plugin Directory</a> right on this page, or upload a plugin in .zip format by clicking the button above.'=>'Plugins WordPress Qutlhmey lo’ ’ej vItlhutlh. <a href="%s">WordPress Plugin Directory</a> vItlhutlh Heghpu’ DaghajlaH je, pagh .zip format plugin chIm qay’ vIghItlh.','http://wordpress.org/plugins/hello-dolly/'=>'http://wordpress.org/plugins/hello-dolly/','The theme contains no files.'=>'lo’ Qapchu’ machmey qonwI’ vIghajbe’. ','The package contains no files.'=>'lo’ Qapchu’ machmey qonwI’ vIghajbe’. ','To navigate between revisions, <strong>drag the slider handle left or right</strong> or <strong>use the Previous or Next buttons</strong>.'=>'','Loading&hellip;'=>'','This item has already been deleted.'=>'','The item you are trying to restore from the Trash no longer exists.'=>'','The item you are trying to move to the Trash no longer exists.'=>'','Drag the items into the order you prefer. Click the arrow on the right of the item to reveal additional configuration options.'=>'','If you have not yet created any menus, <strong>click the &#8217;create a new menu&#8217; link</strong> to get started'=>'vaj SoH majQa’ menumey chenmoHbe’, <strong>&#8217;chu’ menu chu’&#8217; linkDaq &#8217;click</strong> qonlu’','To restore a revision, <strong>click Restore This Revision</strong>.'=>'QapQo’ revision vItlhutlh, <strong>Revise vItlhutlh</strong> &#8217;click</strong>.','From this screen you can review, compare, and restore revisions:'=>'vaj ghomDaq bIjatlh, bIlegh, ’ej revisionmey vItlhutlh:','Revisions are saved copies of your post or page, which are periodically created as you update your content. The red text on the left shows the content that was removed. The green text on the right shows the content that was added.'=>'Revisionmey DIvI’ qo’ post pagh page copies, vaj poSmoHmey rur. SuD tIqDaq QIj mIw vItlhutlh. Soj tIqDaq QoQ mIw vItlhutlh.','This screen is used for managing your content revisions.'=>'ghomvam vItlhutlh content revisionmey lo’.','Select a Menu'=>'menu chu’','Assigned Menu'=>'menu chu’','Manage Locations'=>'De’ Qapchu’','Edit Menus'=>'menu Qap','To add a new menu instead of assigning an existing one, <strong>click the &#8217;Use new menu&#8217; link</strong>. Your new menu will be automatically assigned to that location in the theme.'=>'chu’ menu chu’ chenmoH, <strong>&#8217;chu’ menu &#8217; linkDaq &#8217;click</strong>. menu chu’ automatic theme locationDaq pe’.','To edit a menu currently assigned to a theme menu location, <strong>click the adjacent &#8217;Edit&#8217; link</strong>'=>'menu theme location assign, <strong>&#8217;Edit&#8217; link qonlu’</strong>','To assign menus to one or more theme menu locations, <strong>select a menu from each location&#8217;s dropdown</strong>. When you are finished, <strong>click Save Changes</strong>'=>'menu location assign, <strong>menu Hoch locationDaq dropdown wIchoH</strong>. Daqvo’, <strong>Save Changes &#8217;click</strong>','This screen is used for globally assigning menus to locations defined by your theme.'=>'ghomvam vItlhutlh theme menu location assign lo’.','Editing Menus'=>'menu Qap','Delete a menu item by <strong>expanding it and clicking the Remove link</strong>'=>'menu item <strong>expand & Remove link qonlu’</strong>','To reorganize menu items, <strong>drag and drop items with your mouse or use your keyboard</strong>. Drag or move a menu item a little to the right to make it a submenu'=>'menu items reorg, <strong>mouse pagh keyboard lo’ drag drop</strong>. menu item yInDaq ’el submenu.','Add one or several items at once by <strong>selecting the checkbox next to each item and clicking Add to Menu</strong>'=>'pagh items Hoch <strong>checkbox wIchoH & Add to Menu qonlu’</strong>','Each navigation menu may contain a mix of links to pages, categories, custom URLs or other content types. Menu links are added by selecting items from the expanding boxes in the left-hand column below.'=>'navigation menu links page, categories, URLs pagh neH. menu links wIchoH expanding boxes tIqDaq.','Menu Management'=>'menu Qap','You can assign individual menus to the theme&#8217;s menu locations by <strong>selecting the desired settings</strong> at the bottom of the menu editor. To assign menus to all theme menu locations at once, <strong>visit the Manage Locations tab</strong> at the top of the screen.'=>'menu location themeDaq <strong>settings wIchoH</strong> menu editor tIqDaq. Hoch theme menu locationwIjDaq <strong>Manage Locations tab wIghItlh</strong>.','To edit an existing menu, <strong>choose a menu from the dropdown and click Select</strong>'=>'menu Qap, <strong>dropdown menu wIchoH & Select qonlu’</strong>','The menu management box at the top of the screen is used to control which menu is opened in the editor below.'=>'menu Qap box tIqDaq menu editor lo’ control.','Add, organize, and modify individual menu items'=>'menu items add, organize, modify','Create, edit, and delete menus'=>'menumey chu’, Qap, delete','From this screen you can:'=>'ghomvam bIjatlh:','This screen is used for managing your navigation menus.'=>'navigation menumey Qap lo’ ghomvam.','Menu locations updated.'=>'menu locations chu’.','Your latest changes were saved as a revision.'=>'chu’ changes revision. vItlhutlh.','Audio Codec:'=>'Audio Codec:','Audio Format:'=>'Audio Format:','Genre: %s.'=>'mIw: %s.','Track %1$s of %2$s.'=>'mIw %1$s %2$sDaq.','Released: %d.'=>'ngevwI\': %d.','%1$s by %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s\'vaD.','Restore This Revision'=>'ghItlh chenmoH','Denied: %s'=>'Qaghmey: %s','Capabilities'=>'Qaghmey','Menu Settings'=>'menwIj Qap','Menu structure'=>'menwIj De\'','To the top'=>'chu\'choH','Down one'=>'wa\' mIw Hegh','Up one'=>'wa\' mIw chu\'','Move'=>'naw\'','Draft created on %1$s at %2$s'=>'ghItlhwIj %1$s poH %2$sDaq chenmoH','You cannot move this item to the Trash. %s is currently editing.'=>'vaj HIvje\' vIghro\'be\'pu\'vam HeghmeH. %s DaH jIHvaD Qutlh.','%s has taken over and is currently editing.'=>'%s SuqmoHpu\' je DaH jIHvaD Qutlh.','Select a menu to edit:'=>'menwIj chenmoHmeH menwIj wIv:','Thank you for Updating! Please visit the <a href="%s">Upgrade Network</a> page to update all your sites.'=>'Qapla\'! Qapchu\'lta\'! <a href="%s">Network Qapchu\'lta\'</a> DaqaSmoHmeH DaH nobmeH nIvbogh mIw.','All right, sparky! You&#8217;ve made it through this part of the installation. WordPress can now communicate with your database. If you are ready, time now to&hellip;'=>'majQa\'! bI\'IHvamDaq Qapchu\'lta\'! WordPress DaH Databaseda QumwI\'vaD QummoH. bI\'IHchu\'meH poH vIta\'.','Client version'=>'QumwI\' vIghro\'','Auto add pages'=>'tlhu\'mey chu\'','Give your menu a name, then click Create Menu.'=>'menwIj pong vItlhutlh, vaj menwIj chenmoH.','Edit your default menu by adding or removing items. Drag the items into the order you prefer. Click Create Menu to save your changes.'=>'menwIj vItlhutlhmeH, mIwmey vItlhutlh je. mIwmey chenmoH, pagh vItlhutlh. menwIj chenmoHmeH chenmoH.','Menu 1'=>'menwIj wa\'','Selected menus have been successfully deleted.'=>'wIv menwIj Qapchu\'lta\'','For PHP files, you can use the documentation dropdown to select from functions recognized in that file. Look Up takes you to a web page with reference material about that particular function.'=>'PHP wej vIghro\'lI\'vamDaq, mIw chenmoHmeH tIghmey vIghro\'lI\'vamDaq mIw chenmoH. "vaj" QumwI\'vaD QumwI\'vamvaD QumwI\'vamvamvaD DaqaSmoH.','Look Up'=>'QumwI\'','The documentation menu below the editor lists the PHP functions recognized in the plugin file. Clicking Look Up takes you to a web page about that particular function.'=>'mIw chenmoHmeH tIghmeyDaq PHP mIw chenmoHmey. "QumwI\'" QumwI\'vamvaD mIw chenmoHvamvamvaD DaqaSmoH.','%s is currently editing'=>'%s DaH jIHvaD Qutlh','You can upload and insert media (images, audio, documents, etc.) by clicking the Add Media button. You can select from the images and files already uploaded to the Media Library, or upload new media to add to your page or post. To create an image gallery, select the images to add and click the &#8220;Create a new gallery&#8221; button.'=>'media (ngevwI\', Qum, Deghmey, etc) SIQ je vIghro\'laH "media chenmoH" Qum. media libraryDaq ngevwI\'mey je Deghmey wIvmeH, pagh media chu\'meH. ngevwI\' chenmoHmeH, ngevwI\'mey wIv je "chu\' ngevwI\' chenmoH" Qum.','Image rotation is not supported by your web host.'=>'nIvbogh QImroq QayʼmeH SoH DeSDuʼbeʼtaH.','If you are looking to use the link manager, please install the <a href="%s">Link Manager plugin</a>.'=>'vaj link manager DaqaSmoHmoHmeH, <a href="%s">Link Manager plugin</a> DaqaS.','When changing themes, there is often some variation in the number and setup of widget areas/sidebars and sometimes these conflicts make the transition a bit less smooth. If you changed themes and seem to be missing widgets, scroll down on this screen to the Inactive Widgets area, where all of your widgets and their settings will have been saved.'=>'poSmoHmey vIghroʼmey Qapchuʼ pagh, widgetAreas/sidebars vIqawbeʼluʼ je je vIqawbeʼluʼ. poSmoHmey vIghroʼmey vIghroʼmey vItlhobpuʼ, Inactive Widgets wovbeʼ DeS, Hoch widgetmeylIj je settingslIj yIqaw.','<strong>Parent</strong> &mdash; Categories, unlike tags, can have a hierarchy. You might have a Jazz category, and under that have child categories for Bebop and Big Band. Totally optional. To create a subcategory, just choose another category from the Parent dropdown.'=>'<strong>mavwI</strong> &mdash; Categories, tagmey mupwIʼ Hoch vItlhutlh. Suv Jazz category, vaj bebop je big band categorymey vItlhutlh. Qapchuʼ. subcategory vIghroʼ, parent dropdown vIghroʼ.','Several boxes on this screen contain settings for how your content will be published, including:'=>'vaj poSmoHmey DaqaS DeS wovbeʼmey je settingsmey Hoch lIʼlaHbeʼlIj DaqaS.','Inserting Media'=>'Media Qawʼ','The title field and the big Post Editing Area are fixed in place, but you can reposition all the other boxes using drag and drop. You can also minimize or expand them by clicking the title bar of each box. Use the Screen Options tab to unhide more boxes (Excerpt, Send Trackbacks, Custom Fields, Discussion, Slug, Author) or to choose a 1- or 2-column layout for this screen.'=>'title qel je post editing area lugh, other boxmey drag je drop vIvav. minimize pagh expand je. Screen Options tab vIghroʼ (Excerpt, Send Trackbacks, Custom Fields, Discussion, Slug, Author) pagh 1-qaʼ 2-qaʼ layout vIghroʼ.','Do not forget to click &#8220;Save Changes&#8221; when you are done!'=>'QuvmoHlaHbeʼ &#8220;Save Changes&#8221; yIqaw!','To use a background image, simply upload it or choose an image that has already been uploaded to your Media Library by clicking the &#8220;Choose Image&#8221; button. You can display a single instance of your image, or tile it to fill the screen. You can have your background fixed in place, so your site content moves on top of it, or you can have it scroll with your site.'=>'background image vIghroʼ, upload pagh Media Library DaqaSmoHmoHmeH &#8220;Choose Image&#8221; yIqaw. waʼ instance display pagh tile vaj. background fixed pagh scroll vIghroʼ.','The uploaded file is not a valid image. Please try again.'=>'uploaded file image lughbeʼ. yIqaw.','Choose a Custom Header'=>'Custom Header vIghroʼ','Choose a Background Image'=>'Background Image vIghroʼ','In the Header Text section of this page, you can choose whether to display this text or hide it. You can also choose a color for the text by clicking the Select Color button and either typing in a legitimate HTML hex value, e.g. &#8220;#ff0000&#8221; for red, or by choosing a color using the color picker.'=>'Header Text DaqaSmoHmeH, text vIghroʼ pagh yIqaw. Select Color yIqaw je yIqaw HTML hex value, e.g. &#8220;#ff0000&#8221; red pagh color picker vIghroʼ.','You can also choose a background color by clicking the Select Color button and either typing in a legitimate HTML hex value, e.g. &#8220;#ff0000&#8221; for red, or by choosing a color using the color picker.'=>'background color vIghroʼ, Select Color yIqaw je yIqaw HTML hex value, e.g. &#8220;#ff0000&#8221; red pagh color picker vIghroʼ.','In the <strong>In response to</strong> column, there are three elements. The text is the name of the post that inspired the comment, and links to the post editor for that entry. The View Post link leads to that post on your live site. The small bubble with the number in it shows the number of approved comments that post has received. If there are pending comments, a red notification circle with the number of pending comments is displayed. Clicking the notification circle will filter the comments screen to show only pending comments on that post.'=>'In response to column, wej mIw. text post pong, post editor link. View Post je post liveDaq. bubble number approved comments. pending comments, red notification circle pending comments. notification circle click, comments screen pending comments filter.','ID #%1$s: %2$s'=>'ID #%1$s: %2$s','ID #%1$s: %2$s <strong>The current user will not be deleted.</strong>'=>'ID #%1$s: %2$s <strong>DaHjaj user ghuSbe&#39;&#39;lu&#39;.</strong>','Used: %1$s%% of %2$s'=>'vItlhutlh: %1$s%% %2$s','Please select an option.'=>'option vIghroʼ.','After you&#8217;ve done that, click &#8220;Run the installation&#8221;.'=>'qaStaHvIS, &#8220;Run the installation&#8221; yIqaw.','If you want to install a plugin that you&#8217;ve downloaded elsewhere, click the Upload Plugin button above the plugins list. You will be prompted to upload the .zip package, and once uploaded, you can activate the new plugin.'=>'plugin DaqaSmoHmoHmeH, Upload Plugin yIqaw plugins list Dach. .zip package upload, upload vaj plugin DaqaSmoH.','You can also browse a user&#8217;s favorite plugins, by using the Favorites link above the plugins list and entering their WordPress.org username.'=>'user favorite plugins vIghroʼ, Favorites link plugins list Dach je WordPress.org username vIqaw.','If you know what you are looking for, Search is your best bet. The Search screen has options to search the WordPress Plugin Directory for a particular Term, Author, or Tag. You can also search the directory by selecting popular tags. Tags in larger type mean more plugins have been labeled with that tag.'=>'vIqaw, Search vIghroʼ. Search screen options WordPress Plugin Directory Term, Author, Tag laD. popular tags vIghroʼ. large tags plugins vItlhutlh.','It is up to search engines to honor this request.'=>'search engines Qapchuʼ request.','Discourage search engines from indexing this site'=>'search engines pagh site index DaqaSmoH.','Allow search engines to index this site'=>'search engines site index Qap.','Search engine visibility'=>'Search engine visibility','Welcome to WordPress %1$s. You will be redirected to the About WordPress screen. If not, click <a href="%2$s">here</a>.'=>'WordPress %1$s DaqaS. About WordPress screen DaqaS. vaj, <a href="%2$s">wIv</a>.','Get Favorites'=>'Favorites vIghroʼ','Your WordPress.org username:'=>'WordPress.org usernamelIj:','If you have marked plugins as favorites on WordPress.org, you can browse them here.'=>'vaj WordPress.orgDaq plugins qonwI\'pu\' \'oH, tlhIngan Hol DaqaSmoHmeH cha\'logh wejpuH.','Welcome to WordPress!'=>'WordPressDaq QaH!','Search engines discouraged'=>'QInmey QawHaqmey qawlaHbe\'','This <a href="%1$s">child theme</a> requires its parent theme, %2$s.'=>'vaj <a href="%1$s">puq theme</a> tInwI\' theme, %2$s, yIlo\'.','To install the theme so you can preview it with your site&#8217;s content and customize its theme options, click the "Install" button at the top of the left-hand pane. The theme files will be downloaded to your website automatically. When this is complete, the theme is now available for activation, which you can do by clicking the "Activate" link, or by navigating to your Manage Themes screen and clicking the "Live Preview" link under any installed theme&#8217;s thumbnail image.'=>'theme chu\' Hoch HomwIjDaq Qapchu\' preview Qapchu\' vImey, \'ej theme ghotpu\' Qapchu\' options customize, "Install" pongDaq yIQaw. theme mIw \'oH muD Hoch De\'wI\' chenmoH. Qapchu\' DaH, theme pong ghotpu\' activation, yIqaw "Activate" link, pagh Manage Themes SuyDaq yIqaw "Live Preview" link theme thumbnail mIwDaq.','Search by tag'=>'tagDaq Qaw','Search by author'=>'wIvDaq Qaw','Search by keyword'=>'mu\' Qaw','Type of search'=>'Qaw mIw','Screen Options Tab'=>'Screen Options Tab','Contextual Help Tab'=>'Contextual Help Tab','Select comment'=>'QIn wIv','Tags can be selectively converted to categories using the <a href="%s">tag to category converter</a>.'=>'Tags tlhej \'oH categories chu\' <a href="%s">tag to category converter</a> yIlo\'.','You can delete Link 