are I can never get it back or use %s again.'=>'jIyItchu\' vIHutlh, \'ach jIyIn vIneHbe\' \'ej %s qoS vIlo\'be\'.','Remember, once deleted your site cannot be restored.'=>'Qapla\', jIyIt chu\' vaj jIyIn vIghItlhbe\'.','If you do not want to use your %s site any more, you can delete it using the form below. When you click <strong>Delete My Site Permanently</strong> you will be sent an email with a link in it. Click on this link to delete your site.'=>'vam %s qoS vIlo\'be\' \'e\' Do\'Ha\'pu\'. jIyIt chu\' vIHutlh chenmoHmeH, tlha\'pu\'bej. <strong>jIyItchu\' vIHutlh</strong> DaQoytaH, ghItlhmey vIje\' \'e\' yIbuS. DaH yIbuS, qoS vIghItlh \'ach vIlaD.','Thank you. Please check your email for a link to confirm your action. Your site will not be deleted until this link is clicked.'=>'qatlh, ghItlhmey vIbuS. jIyIt chu\' mIw vIghItlhbe\'chu\'.','Sorry, the link you clicked is stale. Please select another option.'=>'qatlh, yIbuS SoH vIghItlh, vaj yIqawQo\'.','Thank you for using %s, your site has been deleted. Happy trails to you until we meet again.'=>'%s vIlo\' SoH, qoS vIghItlh. Qapla\' Hoch, reH wovbe\'vam.','Primary Site'=>'pab QonoS','British English'=>'bretain Hol','American English'=>'mej amerikan Hol','View Site'=>'Daq SoH','Visit Dashboard'=>'Dashboard vItlhutlh','Your Sites'=>'DuHIvpu’ Daqmey','If you reached this screen by accident and meant to visit one of your own sites, here are some shortcuts to help you find your way.'=>'vaj bImejpu’ ’ej Dochmey DunDaqmeylIj Daqmey vIleghmeH, chaq mIwpu’vammo’ vIghaj, DaqmeylIj vIlegh.','You attempted to access the "%1$s" dashboard, but you do not currently have privileges on this site. If you believe you should be able to access the "%1$s" dashboard, please contact your network administrator.'=>'SoH Qapchu’be’ ’e’ Daq “%1$s” dashboard vItlhutlh. vaj “%1$s” dashboard vItlhutlh ’e’ vIchID, network qeylIS lo’laHghach wIv SoH.','MB (Leave blank for network default)'=>'MB (network chuSbe’ qaSpu’ yIghItlh)','[%s] New Admin Email Address'=>'[%s] Admin Email wIv','Disabled'=>'Qapchu’be’','Paused <span class="count">(%s)</span>'=>'pause ‘e’ <span class="count">(%s)</span>' . "\0" . 'pause ‘e’ <span class="count">(%s)</span>','Global Settings'=>'tera’ Settings','You must be a member of at least one site to use this page.'=>'vaj Daqvam vIleghmeH, wa’ DaqDaq HIvje’ SoH.','The primary site you chose does not exist.'=>'choHlu’be’ Daq chu’ SoH.','If you want to run multiple WordPress installations in a single database, change this.'=>'wa’ databaseDaq WordPress vItlhutlhmo’, vaj vIghaj.','Table Prefix'=>'table Qeb','Database Host'=>'database QeH','Database Name'=>'database pong','Below you should enter your database connection details. If you are not sure about these, contact your host.'=>'vaj database Qapchu’ pongmey vIlegh. vaj not Qapchu’be’, host neH.','Let&#8217;s go!'=>'yItlhutlh!','Table prefix (if you want to run more than one WordPress in a single database)'=>'table Qeb (wa’ databaseDaq WordPress vItlhutlhmo’)','Database host'=>'database QeH','Database password'=>'database parol','Database username'=>'database pong chenmoH','Database name'=>'database pong','WordPress &rsaquo; Setup Configuration File'=>'WordPress &rsaquo; setup Qap','The file %1$s already exists one level above your WordPress installation. If you need to reset any of the configuration items in this file, please delete it first. You may try <a href="%2$s">installing now</a>.'=>'laH %1$s Daq WordPress vItlhutlh HochDaq. vaj Qapchu’ghach vItlhutlh, vaj delete. vaj <a href="%2$s">vItlhutlh now</a>.','The file %1$s already exists. If you need to reset any of the configuration items in this file, please delete it first. You may try <a href="%2$s">installing now</a>.'=>'laH %1$s vItlhutlh. vaj Qapchu’ghach vItlhutlh, vaj delete. vaj <a href="%2$s">vItlhutlh now</a>.','Sorry, I need a %s file to work from. Please re-upload this file to your WordPress installation.'=>'HIja’, %s file vIneH. vaj file’vam WordPress vItlhutlhDaq reupload.','To allow use of this page to automatically repair database problems, please add the following line to your %s file. Once this line is added to your config, reload this page.'=>'vaj Daqvam Qapchu’ database vIghaj, vaj %s fileDaq mIw Qaw’ vIje’ tlhutlh. vaj config Daqvam chu’ vIje’ vItlhutlh page.','No comments awaiting moderation.'=>'QInmey Qavvammo’ majQa’be’.','Plugin Homepage &#187;'=>'Plug-in pa’ &#187;','You can export a file of your site&#8217;s content in order to import it into another installation or platform. The export file will be an XML file format called WXR. Posts, pages, comments, custom fields, categories, and tags can be included. You can choose for the WXR file to include only certain posts or pages by setting the dropdown filters to limit the export by category, author, date range by month, or publishing status.'=>'SoH nuqneH ‘oH, Hoch DochDaq wejDIchDaq ghItlhmey vItlhutlhmeH. ghItlhwI’ Dochvam ‘oH XML format, pong WXR. QeDmey, pagh, QInmey, mIw rurmey, chutmey, je tagmey ‘oHmey. SoH ‘oH neH pagh QeDmey pagh paghmey vItlhutlhmeH WXR DochDaq wej, pagh category, pong wIv, jar poH, pagh QeD status cha’logh dropdown filters chenmoH.','Failed to repair the %1$s table. Error: %2$s'=>'%1$s lo’ table HoSHa’be’. Qav: %2$s','New users will receive an email letting them know they&#8217;ve been added as a user for your site. This email will also contain their password. Check the box if you do not want the user to receive a welcome email.'=>'chu’ users ghItlhbogh email chu\' SoH siteDaq user lo’lu\'. EmailDaq passwordvam ‘oH. yIbuS, SoH userDaq welcome email vIlo’be’.','There are unsaved changes that will be lost. \'OK\' to continue, \'Cancel\' to return to the Image Editor.'=>'QIchmey Qapbe’ ‘ej Qaw’be’ ghoS. HIja’ vIghro’, Qapchu’ vIghro’, ‘ach Image Editor retlhDaq HIvje’.','Post via email settings allow you to send your WordPress installation an email with the content of your post. You must set up a secret email account with POP3 access to use this, and any mail received at this address will be posted, so it&#8217;s a good idea to keep this address very secret.'=>'QIn email settings WordPress vItlhutlhmeH QIn email vItlhutlhmeH. SoH secret email account POP3 laHmey vItlhutlhmeH, je emailDaq yIghItlh, vaj HItlhmey secret bImej.','You can filter the list of users by User Role using the text links above the users list to show All, Administrator, Editor, Author, Contributor, or Subscriber. The default view is to show all users. Unused User Roles are not listed.'=>'users listDaq User Role vItlhutlhmeH text links Daq All, Administrator, Editor, Author, Contributor, pagh Subscriber vIbuS. default view Hoch users. Qapbe’ User Roles Hoch list vIlo’be’.','In previous versions of WordPress, all importers were built-in. They have been turned into plugins since most people only use them once or infrequently.'=>'WordPress QIn versionsDaq Hoch imports built-in. plugins chu’lu’ ‘ej Hoch wo’ noblu’ pagh QInmey vIlo’.','There is an autosave of this post that is more recent than the version below. <a href="%s">View the autosave</a>'=>'vam QIn autosave QIn vItlhutlhmeH qet versionDaq. <a href="%s">autosave vIlegh</a>','Image could not be processed. Please go back and try again.'=>'mIch vIje’be’. tlhap ‘ej jIyInmeH.','The active theme is broken. Reverting to the default theme.'=>'theme Daq broken. default theme retlh.','WordPress can also attempt to optimize the database. This improves performance in some situations. Repairing and optimizing the database can take a long time and the database will be locked while optimizing.'=>'WordPress database optimize vItlhutlhmeH. performance Hoch neH poHmey qaStaHvIS. database repair optimize poH Daq, database locked ‘oH.','WordPress can automatically look for some common database problems and repair them. Repairing can take a while, so please be patient.'=>'WordPress database problems vItlhutlhmeH, repair vItlhutlhmeH. Qapchu’ yIbuS.','Repairs complete. Please remove the following line from wp-config.php to prevent this page from being used by unauthorized users.'=>'repairs tlhegh. wp-config.php Daq line vIghItlhbe’ unauthorized users vISovmeH.','The %1$s table is not okay. It is reporting the following error: %2$s. WordPress will attempt to repair this table&hellip;'=>'%1$s table Qapbe’. Qavvam: %2$s. WordPress table repair vItlhutlhmeH&hellip;','Enter the email address or username of an existing user on this network to invite them to this site. That person will be sent an email asking them to confirm the invite.'=>'email pagh pong user networkDaq vIghItlhmeH siteDaq invite. email vIqawlu’ invite confirm.','Enter the email address of an existing user on this network to invite them to this site. That person will be sent an email asking them to confirm the invite.'=>'email user networkDaq vIghItlhmeH siteDaq invite. email vIqawlu’ invite confirm.','Show Toolbar when viewing site'=>'site vIleghlaH Toolbar jIqIm','For more information, see <a href="%s">the release notes</a>.'=>'Hom vIqawlu’ <a href="%s">release notes</a>.','<strong>Version %1$s</strong> addressed some security issues and fixed %2$s bug.'=>'<strong>Version %1$s</strong> bIr jabwI’pu’ ghotpu’ je %2$s bug Qap.' . "\0" . '<strong>Version %1$s</strong> bIr jabwI’pu’ ghotpu’ je %2$s bugs Qap.','<strong>Version %1$s</strong> addressed a security issue and fixed %2$s bug.'=>'<strong>Version %1$s</strong> bIr jabwI’ ghotpu’ je %2$s bug Qap.' . "\0" . '<strong>Version %1$s</strong> bIr jabwI’ ghotpu’ je %2$s bugs Qap.','<strong>Version %1$s</strong> addressed %2$s bug.'=>'<strong>Version %1$s</strong> je %2$s bug Qap.' . "\0" . '<strong>Version %1$s</strong> je %2$s bugs Qap.','<strong>Version %s</strong> addressed some security issues.'=>'<strong>Version %s</strong> bIr jabwI’pu’ ghotpu’ Qap.','Maintenance and Security Release'=>'QaptaHvIS je bIr jabwI’pu’ Release','Security Release'=>'bIr jabwI’pu’ Release','Maintenance Release'=>'QaptaHvIS Release','What&#8217;s New'=>'‘arlogh','This screen allows you to choose your permalink structure. You can choose from common settings or create custom URL structures.'=>'vam screen permalink structure chen. common settings pagh custom URL structure chen.','Welcome to WordPress %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Learn more</a>.'=>'WordPress %1$s Daq nuqneH. <a href="%2$s">Qapchu’ vIlegh</a>.','You can upload media files here without creating a post first. This allows you to upload files to use with posts and pages later and/or to get a web link for a particular file that you can share. There are three options for uploading files:'=>'SoHvaD lengmeyvam wIjDaq chu\'lu\' \'e\' DaSovbe\'chugh. vaj SoHvaD lengmeyvam wIjDaq chu\'lu\' \'ej pagh qelDaq je page-lu\' rurghmey vIghro\' je yIqel \'ej/joq pagh fileDaq lutlh rurbogh web link vItlhutlh. wej Daqmeyvam choHmeH mIwmey:','Adding Tags'=>'Tags chutlh','Adding Categories'=>'Categories chutlh','Troubleshooting'=>'Qapchu\'ghom','How to Update'=>'Qapchu\'ghom neH','Once you&#8217;ve saved the download file, you can use the Import function in another WordPress installation to import the content from this site.'=>'Download fileDaq DaSovpu\'bogh poH, WordPress wIjDaq Import mIw vIlo\' \'ej mIwDaq qonwI\'vamDaq Qapchu\'ghom Qumlaw\' vItlhutlh.','Attaching Files'=>'Files Qap','You can also edit or move multiple posts to the Trash at once. Select the posts you want to act on using the checkboxes, then select the action you want to take from the Bulk actions menu and click Apply.'=>'chay\'vamDaq posts tIn vItlhutlh, QaptaH \'ej TrashDaq jIQong. posts pup vIlo\' ghaHmey vItlhutlhmeH checkboxmey vIlo\', vaj Bulk actions menuDaq mIw vItlhutlh \'ej Apply DuQ.','Available Actions'=>'mIw machmey','You can customize the display of this screen&#8217;s contents in a number of ways:'=>'vaj mIwDaq DuQmeyvam vIlo\' \'ach HochDaq vItlhutlh:','Screen Content'=>'mIw DuQmey','This screen provides access to all of your posts. You can customize the display of this screen to suit your workflow.'=>'mIwDaq Hoch posts vItlhutlh. vaj mIwDaq DuQmeyvam workflowDaq tIgh vIchuS.','If the importer you need is not listed, <a href="%s">search the plugin directory</a> to see if an importer is available.'=>'vaj importer vIlo\'be\'bej \'oHbe\', <a href="%s">plugin directory vIlegh</a> importer wIghajmoHbe\'chu\' \'e\' vIlegh.','Moderating Comments'=>'Comments qar\'a\'','If you want to convert your categories to tags (or vice versa), use the <a href="%s">Categories and Tags Converter</a> available from the Import screen.'=>'vaj categories tagsDaq (jIjatlh pagh) vay\' vIlo\', <a href="%s">Categories and Tags Converter</a> Import mIwDaq vIlo\'.','Adding Plugins'=>'Plugins chutlh','Adding Themes'=>'Themes chutlh','Subscribers can read comments/comment/receive newsletters, etc. but cannot create regular site content.'=>'Subscribers comments wIqaw/receive newsletters, \'ach yor site content ghItlh vIchuSbe\'.','Authors can publish and manage their own posts, and are able to upload files.'=>'Authors posts tlhoyDaq Qap je QapmeH, files chach vIlo\'.','Here is a basic overview of the different user roles and the permissions associated with each one:'=>'vaj mIw user roles je permissionmeyDaq \'oHmey:','User Roles'=>'User roles','Remember to click the Add User button at the bottom of this screen when you are finished.'=>'vaj mIwDaq Add User buttonDaq De\'wI\' neH DuQ.','To add a new user to your site, fill in the form on this screen and click the Add User button at the bottom.'=>'vaj user chu\' siteDaq vItlhutlh, mIwDaq form vItlhutlh \'ej Add User buttonDaq De\'wI\' neH DuQ.','Custom Structures'=>'Custom structures','Common Settings'=>'Common settings','Permalinks are the permanent URLs to your individual pages and blog posts, as well as your category and tag archives. A permalink is the web address used to link to your content. The URL to each post should be permanent, and never change &#8212; hence the name permalink.'=>'Permalinks \'oH permanent URLs pages je blog postsDaq, je categories je tags archives. permalink web address \'oH content link mIw. URL Hoch postDaq permanent \'ej pagh Qav. vaj permalink pong.','You can submit content in several different ways; this screen holds the settings for all of them. The top section controls the editor within the dashboard, while the rest control external publishing methods. For more information on any of these methods, use the documentation links.'=>'vaj content cha\'logh submit, mIwDaq settings Hoch. mIwDaq tera\' editor control, rest external publishing methods control. documentation links vIlo\' Hoch mIwDaq vItlhutlh.','Uploading Files allows you to choose the folder and path for storing your uploaded files.'=>'Uploading files folder je path choose mIw vIlo\'.','Installing themes on Multisite can only be done from the Network Admin section.'=>'themes MultisiteDaq install vIlo\' Network Admin sectionDaq.','If desired, WordPress will automatically alert various services of your new posts.'=>'vaj WordPress automatically alert various services postsDaq.','Post Via Email'=>'Email vItlhutlh','This screen provides many options for controlling the management and display of comments and links to your posts/pages. So many, in fact, they will not all fit here! :) Use the documentation links to get information on what each discussion setting does.'=>'vaj wovbe’vam mIw law’ rurpu’ je ghomDaq rurbogh pagh rurbogh Qapmey je wovbe’vam. nuqDaq bIpIn? :) QumchoHbogh QInmeyDaq jIyInmey rur mIwvamvam tetlhbogh naQmey yIqaw.','You can change your password, turn on keyboard shortcuts, change the color scheme of your WordPress administration screens, and turn off the WYSIWYG (Visual) editor, among other things. You can hide the Toolbar (formerly called the Admin Bar) from the front end of your site, however it cannot be disabled on the admin screens.'=>'','This sidebar is no longer available and does not show anywhere on your site. Remove each of the widgets below to fully remove this inactive sidebar.'=>'','Inactive Sidebar (not used)'=>'','Clicking <strong>Select Files</strong> opens a navigation window showing you files in your operating system. Selecting <strong>Open</strong> after clicking on the file you want activates a progress bar on the uploader screen.'=>'','<strong>Drag and drop</strong> your files into the area below. Multiple files are allowed.'=>'','You can assign keywords to your posts using <strong>tags</strong>. Unlike categories, tags have no hierarchy, meaning there is no relationship from one tag to another.'=>'','You can create groups of links by using Link Categories. Link Category names must be unique and Link Categories are separate from the categories you use for posts.'=>'','Missing Widgets'=>'','Removing and Reusing'=>'','If a media file has not been attached to any content, you will see that in the Uploaded To column, and can click on Attach to launch a small popup that will allow you to search for existing content and attach the file.'=>'','All the files you&#8217;ve uploaded are listed in the Media Library, with the most recent uploads listed first. You can use the Screen Options tab to customize the display of this screen.'=>'','You can also perform the same types of actions, including narrowing the list by using the filters, acting on a page using the action links that appear when you hover over a row, or using the Bulk actions menu to edit the metadata for multiple pages at once.'=>'','Managing pages is very similar to managing posts, and the screens can be customized in the same way.'=>'','Pages are similar to posts in that they have a title, body text, and associated metadata, but they are different in that they are not part of the chronological blog stream, kind of like permanent posts. Pages are not categorized or tagged, but can have a hierarchy. You can nest pages under other pages by making one the &#8220;Parent&#8221; of the other, creating a group of pages.'=>'','Many people take advantage of keyboard shortcuts to moderate their comments more quickly. Use the link to the side to learn more.'=>'','In the <strong>Author</strong> column, in addition to the author&#8217;s name, email address, and site URL, the commenter&#8217;s IP address is shown. Clicking on this link will show you all the comments made from this IP address.'=>'','You can manage comments made on your site similar to the way you manage posts and other content. This screen is customizable in the same ways as other management screens, and you can act on comments using the on-hover action links or the bulk actions.'=>'','Links in the Toolbar at the top of the screen connect your dashboard and the front end of your site, and provide access to your profile and helpful WordPress information.'=>'','Deleting Links'=>'','Links may be separated into Link Categories; these are different than the categories used on your posts.'=>'','<a href="%1$s">Learn more about WordPress %2$s</a>.'=>'','<strong>Edit</strong> takes you to the editable profile screen for that user. You can also reach that screen by clicking on the username.'=>'','Hovering over a row in the users list will display action links that allow you to manage users. You can perform the following actions:'=>'','You can view all posts made by a user by clicking on the number under the Posts column.'=>'','You can hide/display columns based on your needs and decide how many users to list per screen using the Screen Options tab.'=>'','Managing Pages'=>'','<strong>Preview</strong> will show you what your draft post will look like if you publish it. View will take you to your live site to view the post. Which link is available depends on your post&#8217;s status.'=>'','<strong>Trash</strong> removes your post from this list and places it in the Trash, from which you can permanently delete it.'=>'','<strong>Quick Edit</strong> provides inline access to the metadata of your post, allowing you to update post details without leaving this screen.'=>'<strong>Qapchuʼ mIw</strong> chenmoH wIj vItlhutlhpuʼ metadata qoH, HIvjeʼ vItlhutlhpuʼ chenmoHmeH neH screen teraʼ.','<strong>Edit</strong> takes you to the editing screen for that post. You can also reach that screen by clicking on the post title.'=>'<strong>Qapchuʼ mIw</strong> tlheʼwIʼvaD HIvjeʼ. tlheʼwIʼvaD HIvjeʼvam pIm HIvjeʼ waʼ post pongDaq Qaw.','Because this is a multisite installation, you may add accounts that already exist on the Network by specifying a username or email, and defining a role. For more options, such as specifying a password, you have to be a Network Administrator and use the hover link under an existing user&#8217;s name to Edit the user profile under Network Admin > All Users.'=>'vaj multisite tIqDaq Hoch, NetworkDaq nIʼ accounts luchenmoHtaHbogh username pagh email vItlhutlh, je role vItlhutlh. HochmeyvamvaD, password vItlhutlhmoH, Network Administrator beʼ wIj je user pongDaq hover link vIloʼ bImejtaH Network Admin > Hoch Users > user profile QaptaH.','Welcome to WordPress 6.9'=>'WordPress 6.9 qeylIS qar.','Go to Dashboard &rarr; Home'=>'Dashboard &rarr; Home vItlhutlh.','Go to Dashboard &rarr; Updates'=>'Dashboard &rarr; Updates vItlhutlh.','Profile updated.'=>'profile Daq Qap.','You are using the multi-file uploader. Problems? Try the <button %s>browser uploader</button> instead.'=>'tlheʼ multi-file uploader vItlhutlh. Qobmey? <button %s>browser uploader</button> vIloʼ.','Hi,

