%%s','Post Formats'=>'Qu\' mIw','Full Width Template'=>'Hoch yItlhutlh QI\'yaH','Featured Images'=>'QaStaHvIS mIllogh','Featured Image Header'=>'QaStaHvIS mIllogh Hegh','It looks like you\'re using an old version of %s. For the best WordPress experience, please update your browser.'=>'%s wIghajbogh vItlhutlhbogh vIlegh. WordPress chutmeyvam vIghro\' je, SoH browser vIHtaHbogh vIghro\' HIq.','It looks like you\'re using an insecure version of %s. Using an outdated browser makes your computer unsafe. For the best WordPress experience, please update your browser.'=>'%s wIghajbogh vIlegh vIjatlh. mIw jIyInmeyDaq vIghro\' vIghro\' vIghro\' vIghro\' vIghro\' vIghro\' vIghro\'. WordPress chutmeyvam vIghro\' je, SoH browser vIHtaHbogh vIghro\' HIq.','There are some invalid menu items. Please check or delete them.'=>'mIw vIghro\' ghu\'vam vIghajbe\'. vaj jIyIn jIyIn jIyIn jIyIn jIyIn.','You can find additional themes for your site by using the Theme Browser/Installer on this screen, which will display themes from the <a href="%s">WordPress Theme Directory</a>. These themes are designed and developed by third parties, are available free of charge, and are compatible with the license WordPress uses.'=>'vaj SoH SiteDaq Qapchu\' themevam vIghaj, Theme Browser/Installervam DaqaSqa\' je, <a href="%s">WordPress Theme Directory</a> \'e\' vItlhutlh. themevam vaj \'ach nIvbogh, QumpInmey vIghro\' \'ej WordPress pIm vIghro\' vIghro\'.','If you would like to see more plugins to choose from, click on the &#8220;Add Plugin&#8221; button and you will be able to browse or search for additional plugins from the <a href="%s">WordPress Plugin Directory</a>. Plugins in the WordPress Plugin Directory are designed and developed by third parties, and are compatible with the license WordPress uses. Oh, and they are free!'=>'vaj SoH plugins vIleghbogh nIvbogh, &#8220;Add Plugin&#8221; choqDaq click, vaj SoH plugins vIghro\' \'ej wIghro\' je <a href="%s">WordPress Plugin Directory</a> Daq vIlegh. Wor