','You are using an insecure browser!'=>'SoH browser vItlhutlh vIjatlh!','Freedoms'=>'majQa\'pu\'','You can use one of these cool headers or show a random one on each page.'=>'SoH vIlegh headers pagh random pagh ghItlhvam page ngoq.','If you do not want to upload your own image, you can use one of these cool headers, or show a random one.'=>'SoH HoSghaj upload image, SoH vIlegh headers pagh pagh random pagh.','You can choose one of your previously uploaded headers, or show a random one.'=>'SoH headers vIghro\' vIlopQo\' pagh random pagh.','Collapse Menu'=>'menu Qaw\'','Uploaded Images'=>'upload mIllogh','<strong>Random:</strong> Show a different image on each page.'=>'<strong>Random:</strong> page HochDaq mIllogh Dev.','You have specified this user for deletion:'=>'SoH delete vIghro\' uservam:','%s Page Template'=>'%s page template','You cannot delete a plugin while it is active on the main site.'=>'DochmeyvamDaq plug-in vInejbe’pa’ nuqneH’e’ ‘e’ DaHjaj.','This plugin may be active on other sites in the network.'=>'vaj plug-invam Daqmey tIn mIwDaq QaptaH.','Default Post Format'=>'QInmey mI’ ghotpu’','Any edits to files from this screen will be reflected on all sites in the network.'=>'vaj tej DaqmeyDaq mIw chenmoHmey HochDaq lurghmeyvam HochDaq QaptaH.','This screen lists all the existing users for your site. Each user has one of five defined roles as set by the site admin: Site Administrator, Editor, Author, Contributor, or Subscriber. Users with roles other than Administrator will see fewer options in the dashboard navigation when they are logged in, based on their role.'=>'De’vamDaq, Hoch DuQmey lo’laHghachmeyvamvetlh DuQmey lo’laHghachmey qemmoH. Hoch DuQmey ghommey wej vagh DuQmey je ghItlh ‘ach DuQmey Daq Administrator, Editor, Author, Contributor, pagh Subscriber. Administrator yuQmey SuSbogh DuQmey Qapla’ je taH, lo’laHghachmey qaStaHvIS DashboardDaq SIQtaHbogh Qapmey tuy’.','If you want to make changes but do not want them to be overwritten when the plugin 