es to get more information.'=>'image ghobe\' Edit Image thumbnailDaq click, image editor expand, cropping, rotating, flipping, undo, redo icons. right boxes image scale, crop, thumbnail crop different. Help click info.','This screen allows you to edit fields for metadata in a file within the media library.'=>'vaj file media libraryDaq metadata fields edit.','Email or Username'=>'Email pagh Username','Search installed themes'=>'installed themes search.','<strong>Please Note:</strong> Any customizations you have made to theme files will be lost. Please consider using <a href="%s">child themes</a> for modifications.'=>'<strong>Qapla\':</strong> theme file customization QaptaH pagh. <a href="%s">child themes</a> modifications lo\'.','Check again.'=>'check \'oH.','Last checked on %1$s at %2$s.'=>'Last checked on %1$s at %2$s.','Please select one or more plugins to update.'=>'plugin update \'e\' chutmey wIv.','Please select one or more themes to update.'=>'theme update \'e\' chutmey wIv.','The update process is starting. This process may take a while on some hosts, so please be patient.'=>'update Qapla\' Hoch. Qapla\' hostDaq yItlhutlh, yItlhutlh.','Apply Filters'=>'Filters Apply','Editor Style'=>'Editor Style','To perform the requested action, WordPress needs to access your web server.'=>'WordPress web server access Qap.','Current Page'=>'Current Page','No themes match your request.'=>'theme pagh match.','Search Sites'=>'Search Sites','Create a New User'=>'New User Qutlh.','You have %1$s and %2$s.'=>'SoH %1$s \'ej %2$s.','%s site'=>'%s yuQ' . "\0" . '%s yuQmey','%s user'=>'%s loD' . "\0" . '%s loDmey','https://wordpress.org/news/feed/'=>'https://wordpress.org/news/feed/','https://wordpress.org/news/'=>'https://wordpress.org/news/','(Signup has been disabled. Only members of this site can comment.)'=>'(ghItlhvam vIlo\'laHbe\'. tera\' yuQmey DaHjaj \'oHtaHghachmey.)','There is a new version of %1$s available. <a href="%2$s" %3$s>View version %4$s details</a>.'=>'%1$s vItlh